OL,4,CPadel players complete 50-hour world   
OL,5,Crecord bid                             
OL,6,GFour endurance athletes have completed 
OL,7,Ga 50-hour padel marathon in a bid to   
OL,8,Gset a new Guinness World Record and    
OL,9,Graise money for charity.               
OL,11,FBen Stocken, Jonathan Bamford, Eddie   
OL,12,FEdwards and Will Jones began the       
OL,13,Fchallenge on Thursday at Advantage     
OL,14,FPadel in Mudeford, Dorset, and         
OL,15,Ffinished on Saturday evening.          
OL,17,FThe group, known as Padel Gone Bad,    
OL,18,Fhas raised more than #11,000 for       
OL,19,Fchildren's charities Julia's House and 
OL,20,Fthe Ellis Edwards Foundation.          
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
