OL,4,CDecorated soldier takes on South Pole  
OL,5,Ctrek                                   
OL,6,GA highly decorated bomb disposal       
OL,7,Gexpert is preparing to take on an epic 
OL,8,GSouth Pole challenge to raise money    
OL,9,Gfor veterans' mental health.           
OL,11,FMaj James Wadsworth MBE, from          
OL,12,FAldershot in Hampshire, is planning to 
OL,13,Fclimb Antarctica's highest mountain,   
OL,14,FMount Vinson, which stands at 16,050ft 
OL,15,F(4,892m), before skiing 60 nautical    
OL,16,Fmiles (111km) to the South Pole.       
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
